    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a chromosome in the genetic model. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A chromosome is composed of a sequence of loci, where each locus contains an allele. The <ref refid="class_chromosome" kindref="compound">Chromosome</ref> class allows for allele access, modification, adding new alleles, and genetic operations such as allele swapping between chromosomes. Chromosomes can also be cloned. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
